# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
terraform.tfstate.d/
crash.log
*.tfvars          # keep secrets/local values out of git (examples are committed)
!*.tfvars.example
.terraform.lock.hcl
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf

# Credentials — never commit
*sa-key*.json
*service-account*.json
key.json
**/key.json

*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
